message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Spatial Clustering and Locational Correlates of Coworking Spaces in Jeddah: Reproducible Analysis"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-03
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Hardi
    given-names: Apri Zulmi
  - family-names: Tiwari
