  - family-names: Naji
    given-names: Ammar A.
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/jeddah-coworking-spatial-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible GIS and statistical workflow for analysing spatial clustering
  and locational correlates of coworking spaces in Jeddah, Saudi Arabia,
  including Monte Carlo nearest-neighbour analysis, KDE, Ripley's L,
  binary logistic regression, Moran's I residual diagnostics, spatial-scale
  sensitivity, and Firth bias-reduced logistic regression.
keywords:
  - coworking
  - GIS
  - spatial statistics
  - logistic regression
  - Firth regression
  - Jeddah
  - Saudi Arabia
